<!-- 「我的」页里 Evo 那一块：绑定的电脑（可以解绑，每次问要不要同时删掉云端的数据）、扫码绑定、游戏账号、说明。
     字段由 evo/utils/view.js 的 devicesView() 拼好 -->
<view class="evo">
  <view wx:if="{{state === 'loading'}}" class="panel evo-skel"></view>

  <view wx:elif="{{state === 'error'}}" class="msg msg-err">
    <text class="msg-title">{{T.evoLoadFail}}</text>
    <text class="msg-body">{{error}}</text>
    <view class="evo-retry" hover-class="evo-pressed" bindtap="load">{{T.evoRetry}}</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="sec-title">{{T.evoDevices}}</view>
    <view class="panel">
      <text wx:if="{{!v.hasDevices}}" class="evo-dim">{{T.evoNoDevice}}</text>
      <view wx:for="{{v.devices}}" wx:key="id" class="evo-dev {{index === v.devices.length - 1 ? 'evo-dev-last' : ''}}">
        <view class="evo-grow">
          <text class="evo-dev-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.boundAt}}" class="evo-k">{{item.boundAt}}</text>
          <text class="evo-k">{{item.sync}}</text>
          <text class="evo-k">{{item.count}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="evo-unbind" hover-class="evo-pressed" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onUnbind">{{T.evoUnbind}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="evo-cta" hover-class="evo-pressed" bindtap="onScan">{{v.hasDevices ? T.evoScanAnother : T.evoScan}}</view>
    </view>

    <block wx:if="{{v.accounts.length}}">
      <view class="sec-title">{{T.evoAccounts}}</view>
      <view class="panel">
        <view wx:for="{{v.accounts}}" wx:key="key" class="evo-acc">
          <text class="evo-acc-name" user-select="{{true}}">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.names}}" class="evo-k">{{item.names}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="note">{{T.evoAccountsNote}}</view>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="sec-title">{{T.evoAbout}}</view>
    <view class="panel">
      <view class="evo-about"><text class="evo-about-t">{{T.evoAbout1T}}</text><text class="evo-dim">{{T.evoAbout1}}</text></view>
      <view class="evo-about"><text class="evo-about-t">{{T.evoAbout2T}}</text><text class="evo-dim">{{T.evoAbout2}}</text></view>
      <view class="evo-about"><text class="evo-about-t">{{T.evoAbout3T}}</text><text class="evo-dim">{{T.evoAbout3}}</text></view>
      <!-- 不做"点一下复制"：wx.setClipboardData 是隐私接口（static.test.mjs 的黑名单）；网址可以长按选中 -->
      <view class="evo-site-row">
        <text class="evo-k">{{T.evoSite}}</text>
        <text class="evo-site" user-select="{{true}}">evotracker.cn</text>
        <text class="evo-k">{{T.evoSiteHint}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
